        <mxCell id="rules" value="Routing: STATUS/CFLAGS/TOOLCHAIN/BLOCKER live only in rebrew-functions.toml. .c markers never get a STATUS rewrite. Hand-edit of locked TOML fails (0444); use rebrew test / verify / blocker / diff --fix-blocker. Similarity is best-effort: missing resembl leaves CompareResult.similarity = None, never a fake 0." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;fillColor=#fff7ed;strokeColor=#ea580c;fontColor=#7c2d12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
