        <mxCell id="s1" value="&lt;b&gt;Wild gold&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;matching trees&lt;br&gt;decomp.me official dump&lt;br&gt;SM64 CC0; skip OoT until explicit&lt;br&gt;no live API scrape" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#3b82f6;fontColor=#1e3a5f;align=center;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
