        <mxCell id="s4" value="&lt;b&gt;Matching workbench&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;rebrew + GA (this repo)&lt;br&gt;Mode C gold: EXACT/RELOC&lt;br&gt;LLM emits NEAR_MATCHING;&lt;br&gt;GA finishes bytes&lt;br&gt;Mode C loop on adapters: never run" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#bbf7d0;strokeColor=#16a34a;fontColor=#14532d;align=center;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
