        <mxCell id="k2" value="&lt;b&gt;!ARCHIVE/ (gitignored)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;decompllm  Unsloth lab&lt;br&gt;matcher_ml  StarCoder2+GA predecessor&lt;br&gt;re-dataset-generator  factory PRDs&lt;br&gt;reagent  (listed; not this checkout)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9333ea;fontColor=#581c87;align=center;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="340" y="528" width="280" height="140" as="geometry"/>
